{
  "title": "Defuse the Bomb",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "type": "array",
  "tags": [
    "Array",
    "Sliding Window"
  ],
  "description": "Replace every number in an array with the sum of the next k numbers if k > 0, previous k if k < 0, or 0 if k = 0.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. n = code.length\n2. res = new Array(n).fill(0)\n3. if k == 0 return res\n4. start = k > 0 ? 1 : n + k\n5. end = k > 0 ? k : n - 1\n6. sum = sum of range [start, end]\n7. for i = 0 to n - 1:\n8.   res[i] = sum\n9.   sum -= code[start % n]\n10.  start++\n11.  end++\n12.  sum += code[end % n]",
